Package: kitnessGpu
Type: Package
Title: GPU Backend Capability Interface for Cat Genomics Workflows
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Author: Kitness Developers [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Kitness Developers <maintainers@example.org>
Authors@R: c(
    person(
        given = "Kitness",
        family = "Developers",
        email = "maintainers@example.org",
        role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
    )
Description: Provides a small R-facing interface for probing GPU backend
    capabilities and selecting a preferred runtime backend for cat genomics
    workflows. The current contract prioritizes CUDA when an NVIDIA runtime is
    available, then Metal, with documented stub entries for planned ROCm and
    oneAPI integrations.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: false
Depends:
    R (>= 4.3.3)
